    <string name="is_land_price">Parcel price</string>
    <string name="is_buy_land">Buy parcel</string>
    <string name="is_land_bought">Parcel bought</string>
    <string name="is_g_land">Building on free land automatically buys the tiles under it. You can also buy whole 8×8 parcels to stop rivals building next to your hotels. Land near the sea and in busy areas costs more, and prices rise as the island grows.</string>
    <string name="is_g_ads_t">Watching ads</string>
    <string name="is_g_ads">Construction takes a while. Watch an ad to halve the remaining time of any of your buildings under construction. You can also build a Motel for free by watching an ad; you only pay for the land.</string>
