    <string name="is_g_roads_t">Roads</string>
    <string name="is_g_roads">Tourists arrive at the airport and the harbour and travel by road. A hotel or venue with no road next to it gets very few visitors. If its roads link up to the airport or harbour, it becomes more popular still. Tap a building and use the road link button, or draw roads yourself: first tap the start, then the end. Roads only cost their construction; no land is needed.</string>
